{"id":"twitter:2000007653305799121","tweet_id":"2000007653305799121","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2000007653305799121","title":"@BobScheurle @DavidCornDC You also need to know about methodology when looking at descriptive statistics of mass shootings. UCR uses a classification ","summary":"@BobScheurle @DavidCornDC You also need to know about methodology when looking at descriptive statistics of mass shootings. UCR uses a classification of any more than four. This often involves gang, crime, and domestic shootings. Still bad, but different than indiscriminate killings. Need to know how…","date":"2025-12-14","published":"2025-12-14T00:59:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2000006795226722343","reply_tweet_id":"2000006795226722343","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@BobScheurle @DavidCornDC You also need to know about methodology when looking at descriptive statistics of mass shootings.<br><br>UCR uses a classification of any more than four. This often involves gang, crime, and domestic shootings.<br><br>Still bad, but different than indiscriminate killings.<br><br>Need to know how…</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2000007653305799121","display_date":"December 14, 2025 · 00:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
