{"id":"twitter:2000005569793368453","tweet_id":"2000005569793368453","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2000005569793368453","title":"@dirtsleep @DavidCornDC @MediaMatters I also hesitate to say the entire country is unhealthy because of the election. If 187,000 voters across three s","summary":"@dirtsleep @DavidCornDC @MediaMatters I also hesitate to say the entire country is unhealthy because of the election. If 187,000 voters across three states voted differently Trump lost. Remember the floor is 35% in America So 27-30 million would have supported @GOP regardless, and the floor maybe closer to 40-45%…","date":"2025-12-14","published":"2025-12-14T00:51:00+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2000002496165736691","reply_tweet_id":"2000002496165736691","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dirtsleep @DavidCornDC @MediaMatters I also hesitate to say the entire country is unhealthy because of the election.<br><br>If 187,000 voters across three states voted differently Trump lost.<br><br>Remember the floor is 35% in America<br><br>So 27-30 million would have supported @GOP regardless, and the floor maybe closer to 40-45%…</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2000005569793368453","display_date":"December 14, 2025 · 00:51 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
