{"id":"twitter:1999914996654825844","tweet_id":"1999914996654825844","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1999914996654825844","title":"@ZackKorman I like the Estonian model of volunteers, and you don't need the Government's permission. We all know folks who like mucking about. But the","summary":"@ZackKorman I like the Estonian model of volunteers, and you don't need the Government's permission. We all know folks who like mucking about. But there is debate in US Military about establishing separate Cyber force. We also have an annual debate on bifurcating NSA and Cybercommand I…","date":"2025-12-13","published":"2025-12-13T18:51:06+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ZackKorman/status/1999911685394665493","reply_tweet_id":"1999911685394665493","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ZackKorman I like the Estonian model of volunteers, and you don&#x27;t need the Government&#x27;s permission.<br><br>We all know folks who like mucking about. <br><br>But there is debate in US Military about establishing separate Cyber force.<br><br>We also have an annual debate on bifurcating NSA and Cybercommand<br><br>I…</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1999914996654825844","display_date":"December 13, 2025 · 18:51 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1999909577853415552","tweet_id":"1999909577853415552","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1999909577853415552","title":"@ZackKorman Laura Loomer is in charge of NSA hiring and CISA is gutted. A russian propagandist runs the FBI. Many people doubt what would normally be ","summary":"@ZackKorman Laura Loomer is in charge of NSA hiring and CISA is gutted. A russian propagandist runs the FBI. Many people doubt what would normally be a good idea. I prefer National Guard recruiting a civilian cyber force versus volunteers working for a non-existent Cybercomm commander.","date":"2025-12-13","published":"2025-12-13T18:29:34+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ZackKorman/status/1999830806596927985","reply_tweet_id":"1999830806596927985","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ZackKorman Laura Loomer is in charge of NSA hiring and CISA is gutted. A russian propagandist runs the FBI.  Many people doubt what would normally be a good idea.<br><br>I prefer National Guard recruiting a civilian cyber force versus volunteers working for a non-existent Cybercomm commander.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1999909577853415552","display_date":"December 13, 2025 · 18:29 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
