{"id":"twitter:1999858467109233126","tweet_id":"1999858467109233126","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1999858467109233126","title":"@IAMERICAbooted @AIHeretic Culture and 8-9% margins. My last training I wrote was for a laser cutter air gapped because it runs Windows XP. \"The new E","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted @AIHeretic Culture and 8-9% margins. My last training I wrote was for a laser cutter air gapped because it runs Windows XP. \"The new Encrypted USB drives, have a really big ugly stick attached. You can't fit it in your pocket and accidentally take it home.\"","date":"2025-12-13","published":"2025-12-13T15:06:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1999851437636133051","reply_tweet_id":"1999851437636133051","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted @AIHeretic Culture and 8-9% margins.<br><br>My last training I wrote was for a laser cutter air gapped because it runs Windows XP.<br><br>&quot;The new Encrypted USB drives, have a really big ugly stick attached. You can&#x27;t fit it in your pocket and accidentally take it home.&quot;</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1999858467109233126","display_date":"December 13, 2025 · 15:06 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
