{"id":"twitter:1999848215655723172","tweet_id":"1999848215655723172","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1999848215655723172","title":"@AIHeretic @IAMERICAbooted Enron Musk doesn't let me follow people @AIHeretic, but I will 100% be reaching out to pick your brain on DLP in Manufactur","summary":"@AIHeretic @IAMERICAbooted Enron Musk doesn't let me follow people @AIHeretic, but I will 100% be reaching out to pick your brain on DLP in Manufacturing environments Few companies have been running a solution for half a decade, if at all","date":"2025-12-13","published":"2025-12-13T14:25:44+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1999846779685147126","reply_tweet_id":"1999846779685147126","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AIHeretic @IAMERICAbooted Enron Musk doesn&#x27;t let me follow people @AIHeretic, but I will 100% be reaching out to pick your brain on DLP in Manufacturing environments<br><br>Few companies have been running a solution for half a decade, if at all</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1999848215655723172","display_date":"December 13, 2025 · 14:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1999846779685147126","tweet_id":"1999846779685147126","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1999846779685147126","title":"@AIHeretic @IAMERICAbooted 100% to the predatory power of the default. Didn't think about deliberate limiting of Purview. Yet nobody wants to use Sent","summary":"@AIHeretic @IAMERICAbooted 100% to the predatory power of the default. Didn't think about deliberate limiting of Purview. Yet nobody wants to use Sentinel as a SIEM I haven't used GTB yet, and have heard really good things. Trellix, ZScaler, Trend Micro, and CyberHaven, plus onprem tools like BigID","date":"2025-12-13","published":"2025-12-13T14:20:02+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1999844695787044977","reply_tweet_id":"1999844695787044977","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AIHeretic @IAMERICAbooted 100% to the predatory power of the  default.<br><br>Didn&#x27;t think about deliberate limiting of Purview.<br><br>Yet nobody wants to use Sentinel as a SIEM <br><br>I haven&#x27;t used GTB yet, and have heard really good things.<br><br>Trellix, ZScaler, Trend Micro, and CyberHaven, plus onprem tools like BigID</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1999846779685147126","display_date":"December 13, 2025 · 14:20 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1999845014633890156","tweet_id":"1999845014633890156","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1999845014633890156","title":"@IAMERICAbooted @AIHeretic You almost have to for hybrid deployments if DLP is a major part of your ZTA microsegmentation Most manufacturers are stick","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted @AIHeretic You almost have to for hybrid deployments if DLP is a major part of your ZTA microsegmentation Most manufacturers are sticking to Perdue and vlans for OT. There we say moving forward, \"Only SharePoint\" for CUI files. Bosses hate paying for things twice, but Purview not enough","date":"2025-12-13","published":"2025-12-13T14:13:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1999843392453328922","reply_tweet_id":"1999843392453328922","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted @AIHeretic You almost have to for hybrid deployments if DLP is a major part of your ZTA microsegmentation<br><br>Most manufacturers are sticking to Perdue and vlans for OT.<br><br>There we say moving forward, &quot;Only SharePoint&quot; for CUI files.<br><br>Bosses hate paying for things twice, but Purview not enough</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1999845014633890156","display_date":"December 13, 2025 · 14:13 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1999844274997797347","tweet_id":"1999844274997797347","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1999844274997797347","title":"@AIHeretic @IAMERICAbooted Luckily, not for them, hardening the device and FIPS mode... Well you know it's basically wiping the device. Just take ever","summary":"@AIHeretic @IAMERICAbooted Luckily, not for them, hardening the device and FIPS mode... Well you know it's basically wiping the device. Just take everything and cold storage encrypt. Start fresh. After convincing management that you can't use Autodesk 2016.","date":"2025-12-13","published":"2025-12-13T14:10:05+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1999843645306925158","reply_tweet_id":"1999843645306925158","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AIHeretic @IAMERICAbooted Luckily, not for them, hardening the device and FIPS mode... Well you know it&#x27;s basically wiping the device.<br><br>Just take everything and cold storage encrypt. Start fresh. After convincing management that you can&#x27;t use Autodesk 2016.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1999844274997797347","display_date":"December 13, 2025 · 14:10 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1999843645306925158","tweet_id":"1999843645306925158","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1999843645306925158","title":"@AIHeretic @IAMERICAbooted I may start bending your ear. A few of my clients know because of geometry data their gcode is controlled even though it's ","summary":"@AIHeretic @IAMERICAbooted I may start bending your ear. A few of my clients know because of geometry data their gcode is controlled even though it's IP. It's a dual use machine doing commercial and Gov work. Want to use ZTNA and DLP Other clients it's legacy Autodesk files and Bluebeam PDFs on devices","date":"2025-12-13","published":"2025-12-13T14:07:34+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1999842666373145022","reply_tweet_id":"1999842666373145022","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AIHeretic @IAMERICAbooted I may start bending your ear. A few of my clients know because of geometry data their gcode is controlled even though it&#x27;s IP.<br><br>It&#x27;s a dual use machine doing commercial and Gov work. Want to use ZTNA and DLP<br><br>Other clients it&#x27;s legacy Autodesk files and Bluebeam PDFs on devices</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1999843645306925158","display_date":"December 13, 2025 · 14:07 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
