{"id":"twitter:1999842589504049204","tweet_id":"1999842589504049204","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1999842589504049204","title":"@IAMERICAbooted @AIHeretic I am stealing this idea.","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted @AIHeretic I am stealing this idea.","date":"2025-12-13","published":"2025-12-13T14:03:23+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1999840588036780338","reply_tweet_id":"1999840588036780338","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted @AIHeretic I am stealing this idea.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1999842589504049204","display_date":"December 13, 2025 · 14:03 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1999842395240972741","tweet_id":"1999842395240972741","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1999842395240972741","title":"@AIHeretic @IAMERICAbooted Smart approach. End up doing same for legacy files, and then try to start fresh. Most of my manufacturers are hybrid, need ","summary":"@AIHeretic @IAMERICAbooted Smart approach. End up doing same for legacy files, and then try to start fresh. Most of my manufacturers are hybrid, need a third party DLP tool,which get crazy expensive. Easier to say moving forward only RBAC/SharePoint. Try to use DLP and exchange rules to descope email","date":"2025-12-13","published":"2025-12-13T14:02:36+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1999840264840749467","reply_tweet_id":"1999840264840749467","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AIHeretic @IAMERICAbooted Smart approach. End up doing same for legacy files, and then try to start fresh.<br><br>Most of my manufacturers are hybrid, need a third party DLP tool,which get crazy expensive.<br><br>Easier to say moving forward only RBAC/SharePoint. Try to use DLP and exchange rules to descope email</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1999842395240972741","display_date":"December 13, 2025 · 14:02 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1999841249642119532","tweet_id":"1999841249642119532","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1999841249642119532","title":"@AIHeretic @IAMERICAbooted I can post my baseline queries later. If I can get my hands on the contract and actually read the data retention requiremen","summary":"@AIHeretic @IAMERICAbooted I can post my baseline queries later. If I can get my hands on the contract and actually read the data retention requirements I can develop more tricks. But I want to protect the clients IP as much as use DLP to mark CUI. You don't want to give Gov rights to your IP by accident","date":"2025-12-13","published":"2025-12-13T13:58:03+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1999839967929876913","reply_tweet_id":"1999839967929876913","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AIHeretic @IAMERICAbooted I can post my baseline queries later. If I can get my hands on the contract and actually read the data retention requirements I can develop more tricks.<br><br>But I want to protect the clients IP as much as use DLP to mark CUI. You don&#x27;t want to give Gov rights to your IP by accident</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1999841249642119532","display_date":"December 13, 2025 · 13:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
