{"id":"twitter:1999837020248498642","tweet_id":"1999837020248498642","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1999837020248498642","title":"@IAMERICAbooted @AIHeretic I am constantly refining my queries for CUI, even harder when the data was not properly marked, ever. It's easier for me on","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted @AIHeretic I am constantly refining my queries for CUI, even harder when the data was not properly marked, ever. It's easier for me on new vehicles, as I can control labeling at provenance, but the false positives on eDiscovery are crazy. Takes forever, and soo much tweaking","date":"2025-12-13","published":"2025-12-13T13:41:15+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1999681533553311995","reply_tweet_id":"1999681533553311995","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted @AIHeretic I am constantly refining my queries for CUI, even harder when the data was not properly marked, ever.<br><br>It&#x27;s easier for me on new vehicles, as I can control labeling at provenance, but the false positives on eDiscovery are crazy.<br><br>Takes forever, and soo much tweaking</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1999837020248498642","display_date":"December 13, 2025 · 13:41 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
