{"id":"twitter:1999121703985672481","tweet_id":"1999121703985672481","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1999121703985672481","title":"@IAMERICAbooted The DoD also ruled that encrypted CUI is still CUI as cipher text. This means any cloud External Service Provider needs FedRAMP modera","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted The DoD also ruled that encrypted CUI is still CUI as cipher text. This means any cloud External Service Provider needs FedRAMP moderate, which usually means FedRAMP High because ITAR. All cloud back up solutions are suddenly in a panic","date":"2025-12-11","published":"2025-12-11T14:18:50+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1998937375033143588","reply_tweet_id":"1998937375033143588","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted The DoD also ruled that encrypted CUI is still CUI as cipher text.<br><br>This means any cloud External Service Provider needs FedRAMP moderate, which usually means FedRAMP High because ITAR.<br><br>All cloud back up solutions are suddenly in a panic</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1999121703985672481","display_date":"December 11, 2025 · 14:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
