{"id":"twitter:1999120910524055822","tweet_id":"1999120910524055822","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1999120910524055822","title":"@ChrisCnyber @IAMERICAbooted There are no fiduciary responsibilitites so your liability is limited. Most of the risk is around leaking info, not discl","summary":"@ChrisCnyber @IAMERICAbooted There are no fiduciary responsibilitites so your liability is limited. Most of the risk is around leaking info, not disclosing conflict of interest, or deliberately giving bad advice. Just make sure there are Indemnification Provisions in your contract.","date":"2025-12-11","published":"2025-12-11T14:15:41+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ChrisCnyber/status/1999118657847235039","reply_tweet_id":"1999118657847235039","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ChrisCnyber @IAMERICAbooted There are no fiduciary responsibilitites so your liability is limited.<br><br>Most of the risk is around leaking info, not disclosing conflict of interest, or deliberately giving bad advice.<br><br>Just make sure there are Indemnification Provisions in your contract.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1999120910524055822","display_date":"December 11, 2025 · 14:15 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
