{"id":"twitter:1998911666835390713","tweet_id":"1998911666835390713","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1998911666835390713","title":"Fun fact: Premiums climbed 93% annually before the Affordable Care Act and around 67% after. If Red States didn't reject the coverage expansion, and t","summary":"Fun fact: Premiums climbed 93% annually before the Affordable Care Act and around 67% after. If Red States didn't reject the coverage expansion, and the individual mandate survived 50 million more Americans, most healthy and young, would be in the risk pool. https://x.com/Jim_Jordan/status/1998854363348086859","date":"2025-12-11","published":"2025-12-11T00:24:14+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Fun fact: Premiums climbed 93% annually before the Affordable Care Act and around 67% after.<br><br>If Red States didn&#x27;t reject the coverage expansion, and the individual mandate survived<br><br>50 million more Americans, most healthy and young, would be in the risk pool. <a href=\"https://x.com/Jim_Jordan/status/1998854363348086859\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/Jim_Jordan/status/1998854363348086859</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1998911666835390713","display_date":"December 11, 2025 · 00:24 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
