{"id":"twitter:1998581299272102367","tweet_id":"1998581299272102367","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1998581299272102367","title":"@IAMERICAbooted @secbadger_ As you know, I come at it more from compliance than technical implementation so it's all Web server TLS certs, VPN gateway","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted @secbadger_ As you know, I come at it more from compliance than technical implementation so it's all Web server TLS certs, VPN gateway certs, and IPsec/IKE policies for me. Plus FIPS module, S/MIME, and email-signing certs So many firms screw this up from just documenting","date":"2025-12-10","published":"2025-12-10T02:31:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1998577224698806323","reply_tweet_id":"1998577224698806323","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted @secbadger_ As you know, I come at it more from compliance than technical implementation so it&#x27;s all Web server TLS certs, VPN gateway certs, and IPsec/IKE policies for me.<br><br>Plus FIPS module, S/MIME, and email-signing certs<br><br>So many firms screw this up from just documenting</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1998581299272102367","display_date":"December 10, 2025 · 02:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
