{"id":"twitter:1998367896226193738","tweet_id":"1998367896226193738","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1998367896226193738","title":"Hey @Daractenus did you know Romanians played a role in the debate about birthright citizenship in the United States back in 1866? Some, like Senator ","summary":"Hey @Daractenus did you know Romanians played a role in the debate about birthright citizenship in the United States back in 1866? Some, like Senator Cowan, felt Gypsies weren't loyal to America and didn't deserve citizenship. Ultimately children were given citizenship","date":"2025-12-09","published":"2025-12-09T12:23:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Hey @Daractenus did you know Romanians played a role in the debate about birthright citizenship in the United States back in 1866?<br><br>Some, like Senator Cowan, felt Gypsies weren&#x27;t loyal to America and didn&#x27;t deserve citizenship.<br><br>Ultimately children were given citizenship</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1998367896226193738","display_date":"December 09, 2025 · 12:23 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
