{"id":"twitter:1998213231656288426","tweet_id":"1998213231656288426","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1998213231656288426","title":"To be fair, he did throw in both NordVPN and MacAfee Anti-virus. So we know it's safe I don't mind markets of mutual destruction. I just prefer them l","summary":"To be fair, he did throw in both NordVPN and MacAfee Anti-virus. So we know it's safe I don't mind markets of mutual destruction. I just prefer them less State managed. In China, of course, but more so here at home. https://t.co/PIrrlojmUQ","date":"2025-12-09","published":"2025-12-09T02:08:54+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>To be fair, he did throw in both NordVPN and MacAfee Anti-virus.<br><br>So we know it&#x27;s safe<br><br>I don&#x27;t mind markets of mutual destruction. I just prefer them less State managed.<br><br>In China, of course, but more so here at home. <a href=\"https://t.co/PIrrlojmUQ\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/PIrrlojmUQ</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/15c36442a25b34e3d51732d10edd4a2e.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1998213231656288426","display_date":"December 09, 2025 · 02:08 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/15c36442a25b34e3d51732d10edd4a2e.jpg"]}
