{"id":"twitter:1997381761823543527","tweet_id":"1997381761823543527","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1997381761823543527","title":"In America propaganda delivery systems are legal. And it has gotten worse since Citizens United. Now, especially in social media, America is quasi-sta","summary":"In America propaganda delivery systems are legal. And it has gotten worse since Citizens United. Now, especially in social media, America is quasi-state media hiding under a false umbrella of free speech.","date":"2025-12-06","published":"2025-12-06T19:04:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1997380517419753653","reply_tweet_id":"1997380517419753653","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In America propaganda delivery systems are legal.<br><br>And it has gotten worse since Citizens United.<br><br>Now, especially in social media, America is quasi-state media hiding under a false umbrella of free speech.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1997381761823543527","display_date":"December 06, 2025 · 19:04 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1997380517419753653","tweet_id":"1997380517419753653","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1997380517419753653","title":"It's not free speech, because it's not your property. Elon Musk, since the company is private, is the only one with Free Speech on this property. Free","summary":"It's not free speech, because it's not your property. Elon Musk, since the company is private, is the only one with Free Speech on this property. Free Speech simply does not apply between a customer and business. That's a contractual issue.. Sec Rubio should know this https://x.com/simonmaechling/status/1997273123004060146","date":"2025-12-06","published":"2025-12-06T18:59:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>It&#x27;s not free speech, because it&#x27;s not your property.<br><br>Elon Musk, since the company is private, is the only one with Free Speech on this property.<br><br>Free Speech simply does not apply between a customer and business.<br><br>That&#x27;s a contractual issue.. Sec Rubio should know this <a href=\"https://x.com/simonmaechling/status/1997273123004060146\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/simonmaechling/status/1997273123004060146</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1997380517419753653","display_date":"December 06, 2025 · 18:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
