{"id":"twitter:1997375644443795775","tweet_id":"1997375644443795775","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1997375644443795775","title":"@jaanus My take: Under American Free Speech Enron Musk can do what he wants. But DSA is about doing business in the European Union, not speech. Elon i","summary":"@jaanus My take: Under American Free Speech Enron Musk can do what he wants. But DSA is about doing business in the European Union, not speech. Elon is making a business agreement when he chooses to do business in the European Union. He can choose not to be in those markets.","date":"2025-12-06","published":"2025-12-06T18:40:37+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jaanus/status/1997219708479631604","reply_tweet_id":"1997219708479631604","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@jaanus My take:<br><br>Under American Free Speech Enron Musk can do what he wants.<br><br>But DSA is about doing business in the European Union, not speech.<br><br>Elon is making a business agreement when he chooses to do business in the European Union.<br><br>He can choose not to be in those markets.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1997375644443795775","display_date":"December 06, 2025 · 18:40 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
