{"id":"twitter:1996426327688433722","tweet_id":"1996426327688433722","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1996426327688433722","title":"Commenting on something an Inspector General says is not Classified, is by definition not classified. Further Inspector General reports often use port","summary":"Commenting on something an Inspector General says is not Classified, is by definition not classified. Further Inspector General reports often use portion markings. I do not know how this is so hard to understand https://x.com/RyanSaavedra/status/1996388659562783070","date":"2025-12-04","published":"2025-12-04T03:48:22+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Commenting on something an Inspector General says is not Classified, is by definition not classified.<br><br>Further Inspector General reports often use portion markings.<br><br>I do not know how this is so hard to understand <a href=\"https://x.com/RyanSaavedra/status/1996388659562783070\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/RyanSaavedra/status/1996388659562783070</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1996426327688433722","display_date":"December 04, 2025 · 03:48 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1996425844022239430","tweet_id":"1996425844022239430","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1996425844022239430","title":"@capitolhunters Not necessarily. I work with AI companies quite often that deploy to Government systems. They often develop models locally or use fake","summary":"@capitolhunters Not necessarily. I work with AI companies quite often that deploy to Government systems. They often develop models locally or use fake data and develop low and deploy high. There are numerous LLMs available for IL5+ Clouds as well.","date":"2025-12-04","published":"2025-12-04T03:46:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/capitolhunters/status/1996232575073849847","reply_tweet_id":"1996232575073849847","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@capitolhunters Not necessarily. I work with AI companies quite often that deploy to Government systems. They often develop models locally or use fake data and develop low and deploy high.<br><br>There are numerous LLMs available for IL5+ Clouds as well.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1996425844022239430","display_date":"December 04, 2025 · 03:46 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
