{"id":"twitter:1995593914942906731","tweet_id":"1995593914942906731","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1995593914942906731","title":"@ClassicCodNjoyr @TwoRulesOfWar Trenches are looking a lot like WWI. People get stuck in position for days, because drones make evac impossible. Just ","summary":"@ClassicCodNjoyr @TwoRulesOfWar Trenches are looking a lot like WWI. People get stuck in position for days, because drones make evac impossible. Just expressing the point that executing criminal drug runners and killing people who invaded your country with an FPV is not the same. It's a silly metaphor","date":"2025-12-01","published":"2025-12-01T20:40:40+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ClassicCodNjoyr/status/1995518828663763241","reply_tweet_id":"1995518828663763241","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ClassicCodNjoyr @TwoRulesOfWar Trenches are looking a lot like WWI. People get stuck in position for days, because drones make evac impossible.<br><br>Just expressing the point that executing criminal drug runners and killing people who invaded your country with an FPV is not the same.<br><br>It&#x27;s a silly metaphor</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1995593914942906731","display_date":"December 01, 2025 · 20:40 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
