{"id":"twitter:1995539127580676512","tweet_id":"1995539127580676512","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1995539127580676512","title":"\"tu quoque\" That's not how a whataobutism works and it is unrelated to cognitive dissonance it's more about turnign around to accuse the accuser so as","summary":"\"tu quoque\" That's not how a whataobutism works and it is unrelated to cognitive dissonance it's more about turnign around to accuse the accuser so as to avoid the issue at hand, say SOCOM killing criminals in the Carribean without trial https://x.com/levine2001/status/1995537696127852705","date":"2025-12-01","published":"2025-12-01T17:02:57+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>&quot;tu quoque&quot;<br><br>That&#x27;s not how a whataobutism works and it is unrelated to cognitive dissonance<br><br>it&#x27;s more about turnign around to accuse the accuser so as to avoid the issue at hand,<br><br>say SOCOM killing criminals in the Carribean without trial <a href=\"https://x.com/levine2001/status/1995537696127852705\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/levine2001/status/1995537696127852705</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1995539127580676512","display_date":"December 01, 2025 · 17:02 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1995538649614516614","tweet_id":"1995538649614516614","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1995538649614516614","title":"@Iron_Yuppie To use a slippery slop argument, when saying, \"it's okay for SOCOM to kill criminals without trial because nobody cared about Afghan dron","summary":"@Iron_Yuppie To use a slippery slop argument, when saying, \"it's okay for SOCOM to kill criminals without trial because nobody cared about Afghan drone strikes\" Makes no sense. That is arguing in favor of the slippery slope.","date":"2025-12-01","published":"2025-12-01T17:01:04+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Iron_Yuppie/status/1995538272534081807","reply_tweet_id":"1995538272534081807","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Iron_Yuppie To use a slippery slop argument, when saying, &quot;it&#x27;s okay for SOCOM to kill criminals without trial because nobody cared about Afghan drone strikes&quot;<br><br>Makes no sense. That is arguing in favor of the slippery slope.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1995538649614516614","display_date":"December 01, 2025 · 17:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
