{"id":"twitter:1995532004591632737","tweet_id":"1995532004591632737","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1995532004591632737","title":"You can say that Obama's drone policy is wrong or not wrong. If you agree the policy is wrong, then using it as justification for SOCOM's murder theat","summary":"You can say that Obama's drone policy is wrong or not wrong. If you agree the policy is wrong, then using it as justification for SOCOM's murder theater does not make logical sense https://x.com/WhiskeySlvrBall/status/1995531465950392618","date":"2025-12-01","published":"2025-12-01T16:34:39+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>You can say that Obama&#x27;s drone policy is wrong or not wrong.<br><br>If you agree the policy is wrong, then using it as justification for SOCOM&#x27;s murder theater does not make logical sense <a href=\"https://x.com/WhiskeySlvrBall/status/1995531465950392618\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/WhiskeySlvrBall/status/1995531465950392618</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1995532004591632737","display_date":"December 01, 2025 · 16:34 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
