{"id":"twitter:1995531203144024101","tweet_id":"1995531203144024101","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1995531203144024101","title":"You can argue Obama did not deserve the Nobel Peace Prize when he had military interventions going in eight countries. You can't argue the inappropria","summary":"You can argue Obama did not deserve the Nobel Peace Prize when he had military interventions going in eight countries. You can't argue the inappropriate award justifies the killing of criminals by SOCOM without trial. They are unrelated https://x.com/WhiskeySlvrBall/status/1995530424114680000","date":"2025-12-01","published":"2025-12-01T16:31:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>You can argue Obama did not deserve the Nobel Peace Prize when he had military interventions going in eight countries.<br><br>You can&#x27;t argue the inappropriate award justifies the killing of criminals by SOCOM without trial.<br><br>They are unrelated <a href=\"https://x.com/WhiskeySlvrBall/status/1995530424114680000\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/WhiskeySlvrBall/status/1995530424114680000</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1995531203144024101","display_date":"December 01, 2025 · 16:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
