{"id":"twitter:1995530142064804205","tweet_id":"1995530142064804205","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1995530142064804205","title":"You want to argue criminals can be killed by the US Military without trial, you can. You want to argue Obama's drone policy was illegal, you can You c","summary":"You want to argue criminals can be killed by the US Military without trial, you can. You want to argue Obama's drone policy was illegal, you can You can't use one instance to say the other instance is legal because nobody cared about the illegality the first time. https://x.com/RealGlobalPol/status/1995529551556800958","date":"2025-12-01","published":"2025-12-01T16:27:15+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>You want to argue criminals can be killed by the US Military without trial, you can.<br><br>You want to argue Obama&#x27;s drone policy was illegal, you can<br><br>You can&#x27;t use one instance to say the other instance is legal because nobody cared about the illegality the first time. <a href=\"https://x.com/RealGlobalPol/status/1995529551556800958\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/RealGlobalPol/status/1995529551556800958</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1995530142064804205","display_date":"December 01, 2025 · 16:27 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
