{"id":"twitter:1995527825718145075","tweet_id":"1995527825718145075","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1995527825718145075","title":"@redsteeze Yes. Children being killed in Drone strikes in Afghanistan is unrelated to SOCOM killing drug runners in the Carribean You are using whatab","summary":"@redsteeze Yes. Children being killed in Drone strikes in Afghanistan is unrelated to SOCOM killing drug runners in the Carribean You are using whataboutism as a classical rhetorical technique, now adding an appeal to moral authority. Doesn't make you less wrong.","date":"2025-12-01","published":"2025-12-01T16:18:03+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/redsteeze/status/1995527243125399665","reply_tweet_id":"1995527243125399665","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@redsteeze Yes.<br><br>Children being killed in Drone strikes in Afghanistan is unrelated to SOCOM killing drug runners in the Carribean<br><br>You are using whataboutism as a classical rhetorical technique, now adding an appeal to moral authority.<br><br>Doesn&#x27;t make you less wrong.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1995527825718145075","display_date":"December 01, 2025 · 16:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
