{"id":"twitter:1995123807279784003","tweet_id":"1995123807279784003","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1995123807279784003","title":"Say you have a box of crayons, for you to munch on. The box of crayons can be real, but people can put in extra burnt orange crayons for you to eat. C","summary":"Say you have a box of crayons, for you to munch on. The box of crayons can be real, but people can put in extra burnt orange crayons for you to eat. Can even sneak in crayons you own. Files and laptops work the same way. Not one person says the laptop was fake. https://x.com/Mstrainer19/status/1995122886470783311","date":"2025-11-30","published":"2025-11-30T13:32:37+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Say you have a box of crayons, for you to munch on.<br><br>The box of crayons can be real, but people can put in extra burnt orange crayons for you to eat.<br><br>Can even sneak in crayons you own. <br><br>Files and laptops work the same way.<br><br>Not one person says the laptop was fake. <a href=\"https://x.com/Mstrainer19/status/1995122886470783311\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/Mstrainer19/status/1995122886470783311</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1995123807279784003","display_date":"November 30, 2025 · 13:32 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
