{"id":"twitter:2071935621363368090","tweet_id":"2071935621363368090","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2071935621363368090","title":"The Marines of the 34th were always hometown heroes In 2018 the unit formed as the 124th Territorial Defense Brigade. Then in February 2025 it was reo","summary":"The Marines of the 34th were always hometown heroes In 2018 the unit formed as the 124th Territorial Defense Brigade. Then in February 2025 it was reorganized as the 34th Coastal Defense Brigade. In March 2026 the Brigade was reorganized into the 34th Separate Marine… https://t.co/dCXYT9KLxg","date":"2026-06-30","published":"2026-06-30T12:35:21+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2071933971772952988","reply_tweet_id":"2071933971772952988","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The Marines of the 34th were always hometown heroes<br><br>In 2018 the unit  formed as the 124th Territorial Defense Brigade.<br><br>Then in February 2025  it was reorganized as the 34th Coastal Defense Brigade.<br><br>In March 2026 the Brigade was reorganized into the 34th Separate Marine… <a href=\"https://t.co/dCXYT9KLxg\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/dCXYT9KLxg</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/872b3ea44b8c9ca3344417605589eb77.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2071935621363368090","display_date":"June 30, 2026 · 12:35 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/872b3ea44b8c9ca3344417605589eb77.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:2071933971772952988","tweet_id":"2071933971772952988","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2071933971772952988","title":"The first written record of the Dnipro River as Borysthenes was recorded by Herodotus. Borysfen was chosen to restore historical military traditions e","summary":"The first written record of the Dnipro River as Borysthenes was recorded by Herodotus. Borysfen was chosen to restore historical military traditions erased by russian imperialiam, recognize the brigade's exemplary combat service, and honor its defense of the Kherson region https://t.co/05s0Gw0ewb","date":"2026-06-30","published":"2026-06-30T12:28:48+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2071932915416436916","reply_tweet_id":"2071932915416436916","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The first written record of the Dnipro River as Borysthenes was recorded by Herodotus.<br><br>Borysfen was chosen to  restore historical military traditions erased by russian imperialiam, recognize the brigade&#x27;s exemplary combat service, and honor its defense of the Kherson region <a href=\"https://t.co/05s0Gw0ewb\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/05s0Gw0ewb</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/982829107cbf1942759e76da1022cec1.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2071933971772952988","display_date":"June 30, 2026 · 12:28 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/982829107cbf1942759e76da1022cec1.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:2071932915416436916","tweet_id":"2071932915416436916","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2071932915416436916","title":"Why \"Borysfen\"? New honorific 34th Separate Marine Brigade officially received the honorary name \"Borysfen\" (Борисфен) by Presidential Decree No. 387/","summary":"Why \"Borysfen\"? New honorific 34th Separate Marine Brigade officially received the honorary name \"Borysfen\" (Борисфен) by Presidential Decree No. 387/2026, which was signed on 18 May 2026 Borysfen\" (Borysthenes) is the ancient Greek name for the Dnipro River https://t.co/MuPC4cTn64","date":"2026-06-30","published":"2026-06-30T12:24:36+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2071917537684590844","reply_tweet_id":"2071917537684590844","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Why &quot;Borysfen&quot;?<br><br>New honorific<br><br>34th Separate Marine Brigade officially received the honorary name &quot;Borysfen&quot; (Борисфен) by Presidential Decree No. 387/2026, which was signed on 18 May 2026<br><br>Borysfen&quot; (Borysthenes) is the ancient Greek name for the Dnipro  River <a href=\"https://t.co/MuPC4cTn64\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/MuPC4cTn64</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/6bf6884056e1f76714d98bd87720cc2b.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2071932915416436916","display_date":"June 30, 2026 · 12:24 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/6bf6884056e1f76714d98bd87720cc2b.jpg"]}
