{"id":"twitter:1993010747081998676","tweet_id":"1993010747081998676","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1993010747081998676","title":"United States v. Johnson (1969) establishes that you can not use a Senators comments in \"another place\" Granted Article I, Section 6, Clause 1 has a t","summary":"United States v. Johnson (1969) establishes that you can not use a Senators comments in \"another place\" Granted Article I, Section 6, Clause 1 has a treason carve out, but is the Pentagon really going to bring @SenMarkKelly back to Active Duty and charge him with treason?????","date":"2025-11-24","published":"2025-11-24T17:36:05+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1993008331875926068","reply_tweet_id":"1993008331875926068","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>United States v. Johnson (1969)  establishes that you can not use a Senators comments in &quot;another place&quot;<br><br>Granted Article I, Section 6, Clause 1 has a treason carve out, but is the Pentagon really going to bring @SenMarkKelly back to Active Duty and charge him with treason?????</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1993010747081998676","display_date":"November 24, 2025 · 17:36 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1993008331875926068","tweet_id":"1993008331875926068","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1993008331875926068","title":"Pentagon is now targeting Senators for exercising not only Free Speech, but the Speech and Debate Clause of the Constitution Tenney v. Brandhove (1951","summary":"Pentagon is now targeting Senators for exercising not only Free Speech, but the Speech and Debate Clause of the Constitution Tenney v. Brandhove (1951) basically spells out that other Branches can't harass the Legislative Branch What the Pentagon is doing is dangerous. https://t.co/E51kdbEnZu","date":"2025-11-24","published":"2025-11-24T17:26:29+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Pentagon is now  targeting  Senators for exercising not only Free Speech, but the Speech and Debate Clause of the Constitution<br><br>Tenney v. Brandhove (1951) basically spells out that other Branches can&#x27;t harass the Legislative Branch<br><br>What the Pentagon is doing is dangerous. <a href=\"https://t.co/E51kdbEnZu\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/E51kdbEnZu</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/36cc393ebf16c00606c025534c2b8a7b.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1993008331875926068","display_date":"November 24, 2025 · 17:26 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/36cc393ebf16c00606c025534c2b8a7b.jpg"]}
