{"id":"twitter:1992745449145704903","tweet_id":"1992745449145704903","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1992745449145704903","title":"@adhdwonderwoman Yes. Sure If you go with the video game analogy, each node is an island with mini-bosses, NPCs that flow into level bosses. There is ","summary":"@adhdwonderwoman Yes. Sure If you go with the video game analogy, each node is an island with mini-bosses, NPCs that flow into level bosses. There is always a central organizing Island that connects the nodes.","date":"2025-11-24","published":"2025-11-24T00:01:53+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/adhdwonderwoman/status/1992744653565858284","reply_tweet_id":"1992744653565858284","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@adhdwonderwoman Yes. Sure<br><br>If you go with the video game analogy, each node is an island with mini-bosses, NPCs that flow into level bosses.<br><br>There is always a central organizing Island that connects the nodes.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1992745449145704903","display_date":"November 24, 2025 · 00:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
