{"id":"twitter:1992744015796818080","tweet_id":"1992744015796818080","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1992744015796818080","title":"@adhdwonderwoman I call it the disinfo Shrill Chain. Never tried to do it as an infographic. I think in your version because you are describing social","summary":"@adhdwonderwoman I call it the disinfo Shrill Chain. Never tried to do it as an infographic. I think in your version because you are describing social networking in a MI d map people expect it to be a network map But more a mind map Quick prototype how I might try to illustrate the nodes https://t.co/39VEw5lN2a","date":"2025-11-23","published":"2025-11-23T23:56:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/adhdwonderwoman/status/1992743274898207148","reply_tweet_id":"1992743274898207148","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@adhdwonderwoman I call it the disinfo Shrill Chain.<br><br>Never tried to do it as an infographic.<br><br>I think in your version because you are describing social networking in a MI d map people expect it to be a network map<br><br>But  more a mind map<br><br>Quick prototype how I might try to illustrate the nodes <a href=\"https://t.co/39VEw5lN2a\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/39VEw5lN2a</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/892c94fd2aa6ec9e16a9d27af5d7a2f8.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1992744015796818080","display_date":"November 23, 2025 · 23:56 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/892c94fd2aa6ec9e16a9d27af5d7a2f8.jpg"]}
