{"id":"twitter:1992291081065537772","tweet_id":"1992291081065537772","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1992291081065537772","title":"@HouseOfFaust @IceSolst This is why I keep putting in mid-level career NSF/SBA any RFP focused on manufacturing and cyber. Plenty of people wasting mo","summary":"@HouseOfFaust @IceSolst This is why I keep putting in mid-level career NSF/SBA any RFP focused on manufacturing and cyber. Plenty of people wasting money on bootcamps, highly skilled engineers can write salaries, but it's the mid career bottleneck of folks working with SMBs and their IT/MSPs","date":"2025-11-22","published":"2025-11-22T17:56:23+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/HouseOfFaust/status/1992271899901214976","reply_tweet_id":"1992271899901214976","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@HouseOfFaust @IceSolst This is why I keep putting in mid-level career NSF/SBA any RFP focused on manufacturing and cyber. Plenty of people wasting money on bootcamps, highly skilled engineers can write salaries, but it&#x27;s the mid career bottleneck of folks working with SMBs and their IT/MSPs</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1992291081065537772","display_date":"November 22, 2025 · 17:56 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
