{"id":"twitter:1991874595570454881","tweet_id":"1991874595570454881","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1991874595570454881","title":"How much was cut from rural hospitals before the $50 billion bailout? If you take away six apples, but then provide money for one apple You still took","summary":"How much was cut from rural hospitals before the $50 billion bailout? If you take away six apples, but then provide money for one apple You still took away five apples. Just math https://x.com/SenBillCassidy/status/1991569649557737535","date":"2025-11-21","published":"2025-11-21T14:21:25+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>How much was cut from rural hospitals before the $50 billion bailout?<br><br>If you take away six apples, but then provide money for one apple<br><br>You still took away five apples.<br><br>Just math <a href=\"https://x.com/SenBillCassidy/status/1991569649557737535\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/SenBillCassidy/status/1991569649557737535</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1991874595570454881","display_date":"November 21, 2025 · 14:21 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
