{"id":"twitter:1990137186457407745","tweet_id":"1990137186457407745","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1990137186457407745","title":"@ZackKorman SOC as a Service. SIEMs so much more now and it's impossible to separate all acronyms. SOAR, EDR, Vulnerability Analysis, DLP, Insider Thr","summary":"@ZackKorman SOC as a Service. SIEMs so much more now and it's impossible to separate all acronyms. SOAR, EDR, Vulnerability Analysis, DLP, Insider Threat Some point you are just a SOC as SERVICE that hand rolled your detection and response stack Managed Service Security Provider, I guess","date":"2025-11-16","published":"2025-11-16T19:17:34+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ZackKorman/status/1990108128617152776","reply_tweet_id":"1990108128617152776","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ZackKorman SOC as a Service. SIEMs  so much more now and it&#x27;s impossible to separate all acronyms. SOAR, EDR, Vulnerability Analysis, DLP, Insider Threat<br><br>Some point you are just a SOC as SERVICE that hand rolled your detection and response stack<br><br>Managed Service Security Provider, I guess</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1990137186457407745","display_date":"November 16, 2025 · 19:17 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
