{"id":"twitter:1990086969313931487","tweet_id":"1990086969313931487","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1990086969313931487","title":"Dear Tech folk You don't have to share opinions about the Anthropic report if: -You have not read the report -Have not worked on LLM threat models -Ha","summary":"Dear Tech folk You don't have to share opinions about the Anthropic report if: -You have not read the report -Have not worked on LLM threat models -Have not built data structures for different models Please question the motives all parties involved more than share hot takes","date":"2025-11-16","published":"2025-11-16T15:58:02+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Dear Tech folk<br><br>You don&#x27;t have to share opinions about the Anthropic report if:<br>-You have not read the report<br>-Have not worked on LLM threat models<br>-Have not built data structures for different models<br><br>Please question the motives all parties involved more than share hot takes</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1990086969313931487","display_date":"November 16, 2025 · 15:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
