{"id":"twitter:1990060949668016137","tweet_id":"1990060949668016137","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1990060949668016137","title":"@ZackKorman Not super technical and more about leadership and Global threats but I really enjoy Sentinel Blue's, \"The Watchers\" More a history of cybe","summary":"@ZackKorman Not super technical and more about leadership and Global threats but I really enjoy Sentinel Blue's, \"The Watchers\" More a history of cyber podcast rather than a cyber podcast. You get some folks trying to cement their legacy in time, but still good https://youtu.be/Jb3mf8MeWdk?si=2UAGL5wbRR0N8Cg5","date":"2025-11-16","published":"2025-11-16T14:14:38+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ZackKorman/status/1990059621437022218","reply_tweet_id":"1990059621437022218","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ZackKorman Not super technical and more about leadership and Global threats but I really enjoy Sentinel Blue&#x27;s, &quot;The Watchers&quot;<br><br>More a history of cyber podcast rather than a cyber podcast.<br><br>You get some folks trying to cement their legacy in time, but still good<br><br><a href=\"https://youtu.be/Jb3mf8MeWdk?si=2UAGL5wbRR0N8Cg5\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://youtu.be/Jb3mf8MeWdk?si=2UAGL5wbRR0N8Cg5</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1990060949668016137","display_date":"November 16, 2025 · 14:14 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
