{"id":"twitter:1989790744647794970","tweet_id":"1989790744647794970","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1989790744647794970","title":"See so many hybrid deployments. If you don't have good separation of duties things get easily borked with Entra Connect If you give a group broad memb","summary":"See so many hybrid deployments. If you don't have good separation of duties things get easily borked with Entra Connect If you give a group broad membership in Entra ID or don't disable sync I see things break sometimes Least that's my guess, not an expert","date":"2025-11-15","published":"2025-11-15T20:20:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>See so many hybrid deployments. If you don&#x27;t have good separation of duties things get easily borked with Entra Connect<br><br>If you give a group broad membership in Entra ID or don&#x27;t disable sync I see things break sometimes<br><br>Least that&#x27;s my guess, not an expert</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1989790744647794970","display_date":"November 15, 2025 · 20:20 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
