{"id":"twitter:1988425819736469722","tweet_id":"1988425819736469722","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1988425819736469722","title":"That is 100% how it works. When you enroll less people, and take away subsidies The premiums for people without subsidies go up @somewelder Premiums r","summary":"That is 100% how it works. When you enroll less people, and take away subsidies The premiums for people without subsidies go up @somewelder Premiums rose 93% a year before ACA, the bill cut the annual increase to around 60% Want it lower? enroll healthier and younger people https://t.co/3AeAzRD8eZ","date":"2025-11-12","published":"2025-11-12T01:57:13+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1988425271490580837","reply_tweet_id":"1988425271490580837","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>That is 100% how it works. When you enroll less people, and take away subsidies<br><br>The premiums for people without subsidies go up @somewelder<br><br>Premiums rose 93% a year before ACA, the bill cut the annual increase to around 60%<br><br>Want it lower? enroll healthier and younger people <a href=\"https://t.co/3AeAzRD8eZ\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/3AeAzRD8eZ</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/c15dfc8011b4a7a76c6e6e86a323f9f3.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1988425819736469722","display_date":"November 12, 2025 · 01:57 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/c15dfc8011b4a7a76c6e6e86a323f9f3.jpg"]}
