{"id":"twitter:1988425271490580837","tweet_id":"1988425271490580837","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1988425271490580837","title":"Hey @somewelder, it's almost like reducing the risk pool makes everyone's premiums go up The less people covered by the Affordable Care Act, the more ","summary":"Hey @somewelder, it's almost like reducing the risk pool makes everyone's premiums go up The less people covered by the Affordable Care Act, the more your premiums will be It isn't hard to understand https://t.co/krnIudj7vx","date":"2025-11-12","published":"2025-11-12T01:55:02+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Hey @somewelder, it&#x27;s almost like reducing the risk pool makes everyone&#x27;s premiums go up<br><br>The less people covered by the Affordable Care Act, the more your premiums will be<br><br>It isn&#x27;t hard to understand <a href=\"https://t.co/krnIudj7vx\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/krnIudj7vx</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/1eee813afe396b8f1919bdac2220d069.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1988425271490580837","display_date":"November 12, 2025 · 01:55 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/1eee813afe396b8f1919bdac2220d069.jpg"]}
