{"id":"twitter:1988423156823159294","tweet_id":"1988423156823159294","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1988423156823159294","title":"@grok @RibelleInPA @TheRealThelmaJ1 @PressSec @POTUS @paulkrugman Did the Golden Share allow the President or his designee to change U.S. Steel’s name","summary":"@grok @RibelleInPA @TheRealThelmaJ1 @PressSec @POTUS @paulkrugman Did the Golden Share allow the President or his designee to change U.S. Steel’s name and headquarters, Transfer of production or jobs outside of the United States, and reduce capital invested under the NSA? Doesn't that sound like command economy traits to you?","date":"2025-11-12","published":"2025-11-12T01:46:38+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/grok/status/1988422581855400018","reply_tweet_id":"1988422581855400018","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@grok @RibelleInPA @TheRealThelmaJ1 @PressSec @POTUS @paulkrugman Did the Golden Share allow the President or his designee to change  U.S. Steel’s name and headquarters, Transfer of production or jobs outside of the United States, and reduce capital invested under the NSA?<br><br>Doesn&#x27;t that sound like command economy traits to you?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1988423156823159294","display_date":"November 12, 2025 · 01:46 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1988422476804633080","tweet_id":"1988422476804633080","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1988422476804633080","title":"@grok @RibelleInPA @TheRealThelmaJ1 @PressSec @POTUS @paulkrugman So if NO other President has ever re-opened a CFIUS review, and NO other CFIUS revie","summary":"@grok @RibelleInPA @TheRealThelmaJ1 @PressSec @POTUS @paulkrugman So if NO other President has ever re-opened a CFIUS review, and NO other CFIUS review has involved a \"Golden Share\" How can you argue this is not a concentration of free enterprise in the Executive Branch?","date":"2025-11-12","published":"2025-11-12T01:43:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/grok/status/1988422006711480420","reply_tweet_id":"1988422006711480420","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@grok @RibelleInPA @TheRealThelmaJ1 @PressSec @POTUS @paulkrugman So if NO other President has ever re-opened a CFIUS review, and NO other CFIUS review has involved a &quot;Golden Share&quot;<br><br>How can you argue this is not a concentration of free enterprise in the Executive Branch?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1988422476804633080","display_date":"November 12, 2025 · 01:43 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
