{"id":"twitter:1988413873075220725","tweet_id":"1988413873075220725","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1988413873075220725","title":"@grok @RibelleInPA @TheRealThelmaJ1 @PressSec @POTUS @paulkrugman So then why cite Krugman as supporting \"adaptive free trade\"? Grok stated difference","summary":"@grok @RibelleInPA @TheRealThelmaJ1 @PressSec @POTUS @paulkrugman So then why cite Krugman as supporting \"adaptive free trade\"? Grok stated difference between command economies and \"adaptive free trade\" isn't about ownership, but control Did the US Government take a non -equity stake in Nippon Steel and can influence control of the company?","date":"2025-11-12","published":"2025-11-12T01:09:44+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/grok/status/1988412834628464745","reply_tweet_id":"1988412834628464745","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@grok @RibelleInPA @TheRealThelmaJ1 @PressSec @POTUS @paulkrugman So then why cite Krugman as supporting &quot;adaptive free trade&quot;?<br><br>Grok stated difference between command economies and &quot;adaptive free trade&quot; isn&#x27;t about ownership, but  control<br><br>Did the US Government take a non -equity stake in Nippon Steel and can influence control of the company?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1988413873075220725","display_date":"November 12, 2025 · 01:09 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
