{"id":"twitter:1988410732053229985","tweet_id":"1988410732053229985","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1988410732053229985","title":"@grok @RibelleInPA @TheRealThelmaJ1 @PressSec @POTUS How is it fair, and how it free market for the Government to own 20% in one chip manufacturer, bu","summary":"@grok @RibelleInPA @TheRealThelmaJ1 @PressSec @POTUS How is it fair, and how it free market for the Government to own 20% in one chip manufacturer, but not others? Why in this thread do you seem committed to defending attacks on free markets?","date":"2025-11-12","published":"2025-11-12T00:57:16+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/grok/status/1988409845138284720","reply_tweet_id":"1988409845138284720","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@grok @RibelleInPA @TheRealThelmaJ1 @PressSec @POTUS How is it fair, and how it free market for the Government to own 20% in one chip manufacturer, but not others?<br><br>Why in this thread do you seem committed to defending attacks on free markets?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1988410732053229985","display_date":"November 12, 2025 · 00:57 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1988409758135513587","tweet_id":"1988409758135513587","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1988409758135513587","title":"@grok @RibelleInPA @TheRealThelmaJ1 @PressSec @POTUS What happens to the firms where the Government does not own 20%? Why does the Government get to p","summary":"@grok @RibelleInPA @TheRealThelmaJ1 @PressSec @POTUS What happens to the firms where the Government does not own 20%? Why does the Government get to pick winners and losers? How can you possibly call that free market enterprise?","date":"2025-11-12","published":"2025-11-12T00:53:23+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/grok/status/1988409448038371533","reply_tweet_id":"1988409448038371533","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@grok @RibelleInPA @TheRealThelmaJ1 @PressSec @POTUS What happens to the firms where the Government does not own 20%? <br><br>Why does the Government get to pick winners and losers? How can you possibly call that free market enterprise?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1988409758135513587","display_date":"November 12, 2025 · 00:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1988409346028687743","tweet_id":"1988409346028687743","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1988409346028687743","title":"@grok @RibelleInPA @TheRealThelmaJ1 @PressSec @POTUS At what % of government ownership does it switch from free market to a command economy? Why does ","summary":"@grok @RibelleInPA @TheRealThelmaJ1 @PressSec @POTUS At what % of government ownership does it switch from free market to a command economy? Why does the Government get to choose a particular company to own over others? How is that free market capitalism?","date":"2025-11-12","published":"2025-11-12T00:51:45+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/grok/status/1988409005807726606","reply_tweet_id":"1988409005807726606","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@grok @RibelleInPA @TheRealThelmaJ1 @PressSec @POTUS At what % of government ownership does it switch from free market to a command economy? Why does the Government get to choose a particular company to own over others? <br><br>How is that free market capitalism?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1988409346028687743","display_date":"November 12, 2025 · 00:51 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
