{"id":"twitter:1988290961764741618","tweet_id":"1988290961764741618","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1988290961764741618","title":"@Denver4VA It's a good piece, but to claim Trump and MAGA do not align with Carlson and Heritage seems a bit disengenous. I wonder if it was a pragmat","summary":"@Denver4VA It's a good piece, but to claim Trump and MAGA do not align with Carlson and Heritage seems a bit disengenous. I wonder if it was a pragmatic, but untrue, position to take.","date":"2025-11-11","published":"2025-11-11T17:01:20+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Denver4VA/status/1988249152464048260","reply_tweet_id":"1988249152464048260","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Denver4VA It&#x27;s a good piece, but to claim Trump and MAGA do not align with Carlson and Heritage seems a bit disengenous.<br><br>I wonder if it was a pragmatic, but untrue, position to take.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1988290961764741618","display_date":"November 11, 2025 · 17:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1988290603130778053","tweet_id":"1988290603130778053","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1988290603130778053","title":"@FrankChodorov This is a great piece but to say neo-reactionary conservatism say it doesn't align to Trump and MAGA is a bit disengenous. Maybe it was","summary":"@FrankChodorov This is a great piece but to say neo-reactionary conservatism say it doesn't align to Trump and MAGA is a bit disengenous. Maybe it was a pragmatic position, but anyone who tracked Trump's politics since 1987 can say MAGA aligns with the warped vision of Carlos and Heritage","date":"2025-11-11","published":"2025-11-11T16:59:55+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/FrankChodorov/status/1988015805238317263","reply_tweet_id":"1988015805238317263","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@FrankChodorov This is a great piece but to say neo-reactionary conservatism say it doesn&#x27;t align to Trump and MAGA is a bit disengenous.<br><br>Maybe it was a pragmatic position, but anyone who tracked Trump&#x27;s politics since 1987 can say MAGA  aligns with the warped vision of Carlos and Heritage</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1988290603130778053","display_date":"November 11, 2025 · 16:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1988279675509190808","tweet_id":"1988279675509190808","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1988279675509190808","title":"@SkrzSecurity @IAMERICAbooted Logical boundaries with printers and plotters aren't hard. It's physical boundaries and creating a controlled environmen","summary":"@SkrzSecurity @IAMERICAbooted Logical boundaries with printers and plotters aren't hard. It's physical boundaries and creating a controlled environment. For many companies that do fabrication on site, it makes an Enterprise scope almost inevitable. Or you need to get 50-60year old machinists to change.","date":"2025-11-11","published":"2025-11-11T16:16:29+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/SkrzSecurity/status/1988272748540694990","reply_tweet_id":"1988272748540694990","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@SkrzSecurity @IAMERICAbooted Logical boundaries with printers and plotters aren&#x27;t hard.<br><br>It&#x27;s  physical boundaries and creating a controlled environment.<br><br>For many companies that do fabrication on site, it makes an Enterprise scope almost inevitable.<br><br>Or you need to get 50-60year old machinists to change.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1988279675509190808","display_date":"November 11, 2025 · 16:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
