{"id":"twitter:1988239404410769918","tweet_id":"1988239404410769918","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1988239404410769918","title":"I am not mad at @UPS at all. I think more companies should show this level of transparency. They are making the true cost of tariffs obvious for busin","summary":"I am not mad at @UPS at all. I think more companies should show this level of transparency. They are making the true cost of tariffs obvious for businesses and home owners. This was just a soccer jersey. Imagine the tariffs import businesses must pay.","date":"2025-11-11","published":"2025-11-11T13:36:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1988233048316670342","reply_tweet_id":"1988233048316670342","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>I am not mad at @UPS at all.<br><br>I think more companies should show this level of transparency.<br><br>They  are making the true cost of tariffs obvious for businesses and home owners.<br><br>This was just a soccer jersey.<br><br>Imagine the tariffs import businesses must pay.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1988239404410769918","display_date":"November 11, 2025 · 13:36 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
