{"id":"twitter:1988237062646931648","tweet_id":"1988237062646931648","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1988237062646931648","title":"@ChrisMurphyCT I disagree. If you look at the history of shut downs the opposition never got a legislative outcome. The shut down made the Medicaid cu","summary":"@ChrisMurphyCT I disagree. If you look at the history of shut downs the opposition never got a legislative outcome. The shut down made the Medicaid cuts and Affordable Care Act subsidies a national conversation. It showed the DNC was willing to fight and had a spine. Take the victory","date":"2025-11-11","published":"2025-11-11T13:27:10+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ChrisMurphyCT/status/1987914711971602455","reply_tweet_id":"1987914711971602455","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ChrisMurphyCT I disagree.<br><br>If you look at the history of shut downs the opposition never got a legislative outcome.<br><br>The shut down made the Medicaid cuts and Affordable Care Act subsidies a national conversation.<br><br>It showed the DNC was willing to fight and had a spine.<br><br>Take the victory</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1988237062646931648","display_date":"November 11, 2025 · 13:27 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
