{"id":"twitter:2070552568300802323","tweet_id":"2070552568300802323","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2070552568300802323","title":"Nothing annoys me more when people say, \"Well X wouldn't stop an ATP.\" Not the point. Stop setting up Nation state actors as the minimum bar that must","summary":"Nothing annoys me more when people say, \"Well X wouldn't stop an ATP.\" Not the point. Stop setting up Nation state actors as the minimum bar that must get met. You can't do that, but you can do fix things we know many adversaries exploit and make compromises more difficult https://x.com/techspence/status/2070494794430775483","date":"2026-06-26","published":"2026-06-26T16:59:35+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Nothing annoys me more when people say, &quot;Well X wouldn&#x27;t stop an ATP.&quot;<br><br>Not the point.<br><br>Stop setting up Nation state actors as the minimum bar that must get met.<br><br>You can&#x27;t do that, but you can do fix things we know many adversaries exploit and make compromises more difficult <a href=\"https://x.com/techspence/status/2070494794430775483\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/techspence/status/2070494794430775483</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2070552568300802323","display_date":"June 26, 2026 · 16:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
