{"id":"twitter:1986786810488406433","tweet_id":"1986786810488406433","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1986786810488406433","title":"@EyeofhorusC @IAMERICAbooted And I was using general LLMs and not a trained agent tailored for NIST work. So there is that caveat.","summary":"@EyeofhorusC @IAMERICAbooted And I was using general LLMs and not a trained agent tailored for NIST work. So there is that caveat.","date":"2025-11-07","published":"2025-11-07T13:24:22+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1986767163001115119","reply_tweet_id":"1986767163001115119","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@EyeofhorusC @IAMERICAbooted And I was using general LLMs and not a trained agent tailored for NIST work.<br><br>So there is that caveat.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1986786810488406433","display_date":"November 07, 2025 · 13:24 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1986767163001115119","tweet_id":"1986767163001115119","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1986767163001115119","title":"@EyeofhorusC @IAMERICAbooted I am all for cATO and policy as code. Most LLMs folks I work with are IL-4+, means more rules But a system can't assess i","summary":"@EyeofhorusC @IAMERICAbooted I am all for cATO and policy as code. Most LLMs folks I work with are IL-4+, means more rules But a system can't assess itself. Here are some readings you may like: https://genai.owasp.org/resource/multi-agentic-system-threat-modeling-guide-v1-0/ https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/ai/NIST.AI.800-1.ipd.pdf https://csrc.nist.gov/pub","date":"2025-11-07","published":"2025-11-07T12:06:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/EyeofhorusC/status/1986760069740933352","reply_tweet_id":"1986760069740933352","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@EyeofhorusC @IAMERICAbooted I am all for cATO and policy as code. Most LLMs folks I work with are IL-4+, means more rules<br><br>But a system can&#x27;t assess itself. <br><br>Here are some readings you may like:<br><br><a href=\"https://genai.owasp.org/resource/multi-agentic-system-threat-modeling-guide-v1-0/\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://genai.owasp.org/resource/multi-agentic-system-threat-modeling-guide-v1-0/</a><br><br><a href=\"https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/ai/NIST.AI.800-1.ipd.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/ai/NIST.AI.800-1.ipd.pdf</a><br><br><a href=\"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/218/a/final\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/218/a/final</a><br><br><a href=\"https://csrc.nist.gov/projects/cosais\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://csrc.nist.gov/projects/cosais</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1986767163001115119","display_date":"November 07, 2025 · 12:06 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1986757111150211447","tweet_id":"1986757111150211447","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1986757111150211447","title":"@IAMERICAbooted I tried network diagramming in ChatGPT and Copilot. Because everyone keeps saying compliance is dumb, AI can do it Results are hilario","summary":"@IAMERICAbooted I tried network diagramming in ChatGPT and Copilot. Because everyone keeps saying compliance is dumb, AI can do it Results are hilarious. Invents names of software, gets boundaries wrong. It's close enough to fool folks though if they think AI can do it. https://t.co/lPIa8aMVch","date":"2025-11-07","published":"2025-11-07T11:26:22+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1986621948445483020","reply_tweet_id":"1986621948445483020","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@IAMERICAbooted I tried network diagramming in ChatGPT and Copilot.<br><br>Because everyone keeps saying compliance is dumb, AI can do it<br><br>Results are hilarious.<br><br>Invents names of software, gets boundaries wrong.<br><br>It&#x27;s close enough to fool folks though if they think AI can do it. <a href=\"https://t.co/lPIa8aMVch\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/lPIa8aMVch</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/7c4d8985f5c127980f68a41017616261.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1986757111150211447","display_date":"November 07, 2025 · 11:26 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/7c4d8985f5c127980f68a41017616261.jpg"]}
