{"id":"twitter:1986370192755032250","tweet_id":"1986370192755032250","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1986370192755032250","title":"Some data on Yesterday's fundraising post for @UkrMarine Nine likes, eight reshares, and one comment. 21 engagements and just 272 views. That is a 7% ","summary":"Some data on Yesterday's fundraising post for @UkrMarine Nine likes, eight reshares, and one comment. 21 engagements and just 272 views. That is a 7% engagement rate; amazingly high for a post. It is high because the divisor (272) is artificially low. Throttled https://t.co/tdIs1lsSTp","date":"2025-11-06","published":"2025-11-06T09:48:53+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Some data on Yesterday&#x27;s fundraising post for @UkrMarine<br><br>Nine likes, eight reshares, and one comment.<br><br>21 engagements and just 272 views.<br><br>That is a 7% engagement rate; amazingly high for a post.<br><br>It is high because the divisor (272) is artificially low.<br><br>Throttled <a href=\"https://t.co/tdIs1lsSTp\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/tdIs1lsSTp</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/4094578e5e5630fa259c338ea82c098e.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1986370192755032250","display_date":"November 06, 2025 · 09:48 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/4094578e5e5630fa259c338ea82c098e.jpg"]}
