{"id":"twitter:1985550453753430016","tweet_id":"1985550453753430016","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1985550453753430016","title":"I know my bedtime reading tonight. Why Cannon wasn't removed after the whole special master debacle is mind boggling. Such utter corruption involving ","summary":"I know my bedtime reading tonight. Why Cannon wasn't removed after the whole special master debacle is mind boggling. Such utter corruption involving Cannon. It's hard to believe it could be incompetence alone. You'd have to be really fucking dumb. https://x.com/OldManLefty1/status/1985548915647922510","date":"2025-11-04","published":"2025-11-04T03:31:32+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>I know my bedtime reading tonight.<br><br>Why Cannon wasn&#x27;t removed after the whole special master debacle is mind boggling.<br><br>Such utter corruption involving Cannon.<br><br>It&#x27;s hard to believe it could be incompetence alone.<br><br>You&#x27;d have to be really fucking dumb. <a href=\"https://x.com/OldManLefty1/status/1985548915647922510\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/OldManLefty1/status/1985548915647922510</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1985550453753430016","display_date":"November 04, 2025 · 03:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
