{"id":"twitter:1985387919268593740","tweet_id":"1985387919268593740","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1985387919268593740","title":"Utilizing Purview Compliance Manager to find sensitive data in M365 is just the first step Training and refining your DLP strategy to reduce the false","summary":"Utilizing Purview Compliance Manager to find sensitive data in M365 is just the first step Training and refining your DLP strategy to reduce the false positives is the real work and you don't get instant results. You have to wait to see how bad you screwed up. it's hard","date":"2025-11-03","published":"2025-11-03T16:45:41+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Utilizing Purview Compliance Manager to find sensitive data in M365 is just the first step<br><br>Training and refining your DLP strategy to reduce the false positives is the real work<br><br>and you don&#x27;t get instant results. You have to wait to see how bad you screwed up.<br><br>it&#x27;s hard</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1985387919268593740","display_date":"November 03, 2025 · 16:45 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
