{"id":"twitter:1985375570868293922","tweet_id":"1985375570868293922","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1985375570868293922","title":"@Deep_State_Op @dale_dsll @MasonFlakeAlpha @CaliforniaActi2 @ALJWS @JackRyanlives @FrancaRose33 @Gonz67Ricky @revengehugh @MikeR498 @stevesi28838948 @","summary":"@Deep_State_Op @dale_dsll @MasonFlakeAlpha @CaliforniaActi2 @ALJWS @JackRyanlives @FrancaRose33 @Gonz67Ricky @revengehugh @MikeR498 @stevesi28838948 @LADemKim @FellaBoston You aren't thinking margins in America's weird elections. You only needed to flip 180k across three states. It wasn't Trump getting more Hispanic votes, though he did, but more a matter of","date":"2025-11-03","published":"2025-11-03T15:56:37+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Deep_State_Op/status/1985374944021053500","reply_tweet_id":"1985374944021053500","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Deep_State_Op @dale_dsll @MasonFlakeAlpha @CaliforniaActi2 @ALJWS @JackRyanlives @FrancaRose33 @Gonz67Ricky @revengehugh @MikeR498 @stevesi28838948 @LADemKim @FellaBoston You aren&#x27;t thinking margins in America&#x27;s weird elections.<br><br>You only needed to flip 180k across three states.<br><br>It wasn&#x27;t Trump getting more Hispanic votes, though he did, but more a matter of them staying home<br><br>Trump won an unpopular vote by getting high propensity voters to skip</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1985375570868293922","display_date":"November 03, 2025 · 15:56 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
