{"id":"twitter:1985315698143383922","tweet_id":"1985315698143383922","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1985315698143383922","title":"Many people using Content Search, DLP, and other Purview tools to find Controlled Unclassified Information for the first time. Tough way to learn eDis","summary":"Many people using Content Search, DLP, and other Purview tools to find Controlled Unclassified Information for the first time. Tough way to learn eDiscovery (Content Search) given CUI is famously not marked. 1st run is the beginning. Reducing false positives is real work. https://x.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1985093356196675718","date":"2025-11-03","published":"2025-11-03T11:58:42+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Many people using Content Search, DLP, and other Purview tools to find Controlled Unclassified Information for the first time.<br><br>Tough way to learn eDiscovery (Content Search) given CUI is famously not marked.<br><br>1st run is the beginning. Reducing false positives is real work. <a href=\"https://x.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1985093356196675718\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/IAMERICAbooted/status/1985093356196675718</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1985315698143383922","display_date":"November 03, 2025 · 11:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
