{"id":"twitter:1984673946554286124","tweet_id":"1984673946554286124","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1984673946554286124","title":"@m0bilej0n @IAMERICAbooted @timinbrum I like using Okta (OR similar) for unmanaged endpoints that can come into scope. Can combine that with Condition","summary":"@m0bilej0n @IAMERICAbooted @timinbrum I like using Okta (OR similar) for unmanaged endpoints that can come into scope. Can combine that with Conditional Access and Entra ID with DFCA. Granted I don't have the skills to do it..just like exploring solutions I think could work CASB and AIP/DLP a bit different","date":"2025-11-01","published":"2025-11-01T17:28:36+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/m0bilej0n/status/1984657212782809565","reply_tweet_id":"1984657212782809565","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@m0bilej0n @IAMERICAbooted @timinbrum I like using Okta (OR similar) for unmanaged endpoints that can come into scope.<br><br>Can combine that with Conditional Access and Entra ID with DFCA.<br><br>Granted I don&#x27;t have the skills to do it..just like exploring  solutions I think could work<br><br>CASB and AIP/DLP a bit different</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1984673946554286124","display_date":"November 01, 2025 · 17:28 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
