{"id":"twitter:1984632189607428283","tweet_id":"1984632189607428283","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1984632189607428283","title":"The idea of \"Duck Tape\" is older than WWII. It was used to describe waterproofing tape since the late 1800's The Duct Tape we know was invented by Joh","summary":"The idea of \"Duck Tape\" is older than WWII. It was used to describe waterproofing tape since the late 1800's The Duct Tape we know was invented by Johnson and Johnson in 1943 by making an adhesive on rubber attached to \"duck cloth\" They need new wheels https://t.co/ShuQwRGvv3","date":"2025-11-01","published":"2025-11-01T14:42:41+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1984631418698514440","reply_tweet_id":"1984631418698514440","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The idea of &quot;Duck Tape&quot; is older than WWII. It was used to describe waterproofing tape since the late 1800&#x27;s<br><br>The Duct Tape we know was invented by Johnson and Johnson in 1943 by making an adhesive on rubber attached to &quot;duck cloth&quot;<br><br>They need new wheels <a href=\"https://t.co/ShuQwRGvv3\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/ShuQwRGvv3</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/0b7a9d20951c09d851a41c1538fae8bd.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1984632189607428283","display_date":"November 01, 2025 · 14:42 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/0b7a9d20951c09d851a41c1538fae8bd.jpg"]}
