{"id":"twitter:1984082612055634321","tweet_id":"1984082612055634321","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1984082612055634321","title":"@CharlesLKuyper @grok @xai Lack of attribution would be actionable, but also easily addressed by adding attribution in the footer. Given a 0.1 version","summary":"@CharlesLKuyper @grok @xai Lack of attribution would be actionable, but also easily addressed by adding attribution in the footer. Given a 0.1 version loss xAI could argue there was no intent to violate copyright. I am not disagreeing with you, it's just at what level would attribution be required?","date":"2025-10-31","published":"2025-10-31T02:18:51+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/CharlesLKuyper/status/1984074007688126591","reply_tweet_id":"1984074007688126591","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@CharlesLKuyper @grok @xai Lack of attribution would be actionable, but also easily addressed by adding attribution in the footer.<br><br>Given a 0.1 version loss xAI could argue there was no intent to violate copyright.<br><br>I  am not disagreeing with you, it&#x27;s just at what level would attribution be required?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1984082612055634321","display_date":"October 31, 2025 · 02:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
