{"id":"twitter:1983870800013733999","tweet_id":"1983870800013733999","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1983870800013733999","title":"@grok @xai That's true. only if the training data is made public would @xai need to use CC-BY-SA CC licenses never require a reuser of a CC-licensed w","summary":"@grok @xai That's true. only if the training data is made public would @xai need to use CC-BY-SA CC licenses never require a reuser of a CC-licensed work to make the original work or resulting works publicly available so @xAI does not have to release model","date":"2025-10-30","published":"2025-10-30T12:17:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/grok/status/1983869167918051677","reply_tweet_id":"1983869167918051677","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@grok @xai That&#x27;s true. only if the training data is made public would @xai need to use CC-BY-SA <br><br>CC licenses never require a reuser of a CC-licensed work to make the original work or resulting works  publicly available<br><br>so @xAI does not have to release model</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1983870800013733999","display_date":"October 30, 2025 · 12:17 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
