{"id":"twitter:1983170111281451314","tweet_id":"1983170111281451314","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1983170111281451314","title":"@lsanger Where are the data models? \"If AI models or outputs are based on ShareAlike content and they will be shared publicly, following the ShareAlik","summary":"@lsanger Where are the data models? \"If AI models or outputs are based on ShareAlike content and they will be shared publicly, following the ShareAlike condition would require AI developers to use the same CC license as the original works.\"","date":"2025-10-28","published":"2025-10-28T13:52:54+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/lsanger/status/1983168490224922700","reply_tweet_id":"1983168490224922700","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@lsanger Where are the data models? <br><br>&quot;If AI models or outputs are based on  ShareAlike content and they will be shared publicly, following the  ShareAlike condition would require AI developers to use the same CC  license as the original works.&quot;</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1983170111281451314","display_date":"October 28, 2025 · 13:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
