{"id":"twitter:1981472228848918762","tweet_id":"1981472228848918762","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1981472228848918762","title":"Rates were climbing at 90% before the Affordable Care Act. That fell to around 65% Removing a ton of people from Medicaid reduces the risk pool. Reduc","summary":"Rates were climbing at 90% before the Affordable Care Act. That fell to around 65% Removing a ton of people from Medicaid reduces the risk pool. Reducing the pool increases how much people who remain have to pay. It's just math doing math stuff. https://x.com/RogerMarshallMD/status/1981405163781808632","date":"2025-10-23","published":"2025-10-23T21:26:07+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Rates were climbing at 90% before the Affordable Care Act.<br><br>That fell to around 65%<br><br>Removing a ton of people from Medicaid reduces the risk pool.<br><br>Reducing the pool increases how much people who remain have to pay.<br><br>It&#x27;s just math doing math stuff. <a href=\"https://x.com/RogerMarshallMD/status/1981405163781808632\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/RogerMarshallMD/status/1981405163781808632</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1981472228848918762","display_date":"October 23, 2025 · 21:26 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
