{"id":"twitter:1980641944184451276","tweet_id":"1980641944184451276","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1980641944184451276","title":"On February 27, 1787 Bily would travel to St. Peteresburg to ask Catherine to reinstate the Zaporozhian attributes, a large white with blue cross flag","summary":"On February 27, 1787 Bily would travel to St. Peteresburg to ask Catherine to reinstate the Zaporozhian attributes, a large white with blue cross flag This cross makes up the basis for the Ukrainian Naval flag today https://t.co/otILCxm4LE","date":"2025-10-21","published":"2025-10-21T14:26:52+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1980641280830177377","reply_tweet_id":"1980641280830177377","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>On February 27, 1787 Bily would travel to St. Peteresburg to ask Catherine to reinstate the  Zaporozhian attributes,  a large white with blue cross flag<br><br>This cross makes up the basis for the Ukrainian Naval flag today <a href=\"https://t.co/otILCxm4LE\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/otILCxm4LE</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/0c0cce00bc6e590fdd29e006771bd2b0.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1980641944184451276","display_date":"October 21, 2025 · 14:26 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/0c0cce00bc6e590fdd29e006771bd2b0.png"]}
{"id":"twitter:1980641280830177377","tweet_id":"1980641280830177377","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1980641280830177377","title":"Like many Bily would join up with the Danubian Sich after the Zaporozhian Sich was destroyed in 1775. Kherson, founded in 1778, became a ship building","summary":"Like many Bily would join up with the Danubian Sich after the Zaporozhian Sich was destroyed in 1775. Kherson, founded in 1778, became a ship building center for the Black Sea fleet. Bily oversaw construction and training of future sailors from the Ukrainian population. https://t.co/RNJclTHM41","date":"2025-10-21","published":"2025-10-21T14:24:14+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1980636228165718094","reply_tweet_id":"1980636228165718094","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Like many Bily would join up with the Danubian Sich after the Zaporozhian Sich was destroyed in 1775.<br><br>Kherson, founded in 1778, became a ship building center for the  Black Sea fleet. Bily oversaw construction and  training of future sailors from the Ukrainian population. <a href=\"https://t.co/RNJclTHM41\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/RNJclTHM41</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/7f91f4b09094ddc66e3b76d2f5dfbadc.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1980641280830177377","display_date":"October 21, 2025 · 14:24 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/7f91f4b09094ddc66e3b76d2f5dfbadc.png"]}
