{"id":"twitter:1980280770657714293","tweet_id":"1980280770657714293","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1980280770657714293","title":"The 39th Coastal Defense Brigade, also known as the \"Black Sea Cossacks,\" were formerly the 126th Territorial Defense Brigade is a unit of the Ukraini","summary":"The 39th Coastal Defense Brigade, also known as the \"Black Sea Cossacks,\" were formerly the 126th Territorial Defense Brigade is a unit of the Ukrainian Marine Corps in Odesa. They are fighting now in Kherson. Earlier this fall the Brigade knocked out key russian logistics https://t.co/sYAiKYsX5W","date":"2025-10-20","published":"2025-10-20T14:31:42+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1980274687994118373","reply_tweet_id":"1980274687994118373","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The 39th Coastal Defense Brigade, also known as the &quot;Black Sea Cossacks,&quot; were  formerly the 126th Territorial Defense Brigade is a unit of the Ukrainian Marine Corps in Odesa.<br><br>They are fighting now in Kherson. Earlier this fall the Brigade knocked out key russian logistics <a href=\"https://t.co/sYAiKYsX5W\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/sYAiKYsX5W</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/f286373138d60bdfb5a91ea4f8d29479.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1980280770657714293","display_date":"October 20, 2025 · 14:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/f286373138d60bdfb5a91ea4f8d29479.jpg"]}
