{"id":"twitter:1979942725098119540","tweet_id":"1979942725098119540","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1979942725098119540","title":"Marko then became the commanding officer of the regiment-sized Ukrainian 6th Sich Rifle Infantry Division of the 2nd Polish Army. He commanded the Kyi","summary":"Marko then became the commanding officer of the regiment-sized Ukrainian 6th Sich Rifle Infantry Division of the 2nd Polish Army. He commanded the Kyiv Offensive in 1920 and is seen as a symbol of Polish and Ukrainian Brotherhood. https://t.co/DEUyb25wl9","date":"2025-10-19","published":"2025-10-19T16:08:25+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1979941193111814444","reply_tweet_id":"1979941193111814444","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Marko then became the commanding officer of the regiment-sized Ukrainian 6th Sich Rifle Infantry Division of the 2nd Polish Army.<br><br>He commanded the  Kyiv Offensive in 1920 and is seen as a symbol of Polish and Ukrainian Brotherhood. <a href=\"https://t.co/DEUyb25wl9\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/DEUyb25wl9</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/d19d2b6e33441ad9d4689e0d18ab4c7b.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1979942725098119540","display_date":"October 19, 2025 · 16:08 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/d19d2b6e33441ad9d4689e0d18ab4c7b.jpg"]}
